From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:11:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build_seed: fix zero-inode loop detection and stale seed
 profile handling

Use realpath fallback when directory st_ino is 0 (Windows DirEntry.stat and exFAT volumes) while checking os.lstat and Windows directory reparse points in _verify_no_symlinks_or_unsafe_names and _stage_tree. Validate staged seed profile build versions before mounting DM_GAMES_DIR in _prepare_from_seed, guard report_profile_status against missing build keys, reject mismatched leftover work/profile directories during save_seed/adopt_legacy_work, and clean stale work/profile leftovers on registered seed persistence.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Handle Windows/exFAT zero-inode directory checks and self-heal stale seed profile copies
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1456, LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1478
